{"schema_version":"d_pc_direction_full_review_cover_patch_round2_v1","steam_appid":"4518440","display_title":"超凡功夫之王传奇","sources":{"player":{"label":"普通玩家","readable_count":39,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"p001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"道士的傀儡术非常不错，可以召唤BOSS来一起战斗，有创新！","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198980530569/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p002","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"辣鸡传奇游戏，一点不好玩，不氪金玩不了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198808841411/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p003","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"一坨狗屎，不充钱寸步难行，活动全是托追着你杀，这游戏狗都不玩","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073529466/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p004","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"我原本很喜欢这款游戏，也投入了不少时间和金钱，但经过一段时间的体验后，我无法推荐这款游戏。 首先，游戏运营模式严重依赖新服开设。玩家在新服务器投入资金提升角色实力后，运营方又会将新服与老服合并。合服后，新玩家需要面对积累了更长时间和更多资源的老玩家，之前的投入和竞争优势被迅速稀释。 其次，当《君临传奇》无法正常通过 Steam 充值时，运营方并没有等待 Steam 渠道恢复，而是将玩家迁移到《超凡功夫之王传奇》。游戏内容、角色数据和运营方式几乎完全一致，只是换了一个名字继续运营。 最让我担忧的是支付问题。 在 Steam 充值受限期间，官方客服主动引导玩家通过微信联系客服，并提供二维码进行站外支付。玩家付款后，需要提交付款截图和角色信息，由客服人工发放游戏货币。 作为 Steam 用户，我认为所有游戏内购买都应当通过 Steam 官方支付渠道完成，而不是通过第三方二维码和人工充值方式进行处理。 总结一下： ✔ 传奇类玩法，适合挂机 ✔ 前期成长体验不错 ✘ 新服吸引充值后再合服 ✘ 角色价值容易被稀释 ✘ 《君临传奇》与《超凡功夫之王传奇》运营关系令人质疑 ✘ 出现站外充值及人工发货情况 如果你只是想体验传奇玩法，可以尝试。 如果你计划长期投入大量资金，我建议在充值前充分了解其服务器运营和支付方式。 目前我不推荐这款游戏。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198843850211/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p005","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"氪金游戏","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198110334679/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p006","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"游戏坑的很啊，除了战士什么的是垃圾，一起充值还是战士的天下，我玩了个法师充了几百块钱，戒指只有麻痹戒指，没办法88元充值了一个，带上去什么用也什么战士一袋上可以直接麻到死,法师带上屁用没有那你设计的时候，就不会来个护身戒指什么的，非要什么也没有出个麻痹戒指，真的是妈逼戒指啊。垃圾游戏 垃圾游戏 垃圾游戏垃圾游戏","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199165638844/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p007","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"这游戏谁玩谁傻逼，家里不衬做矿别来，合区速度贼快，毫无商量~玩到最后你们就是老区的玩具，半个月不到合一区，不用等成长，小丑都是自己。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198451251889/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p008","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"垃圾，不充钱完全不能玩，大家别下，我打了2天，都没有充值10块钱厉害，大家就知道这游戏的尿性了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/LEO566/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p009","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"垃圾游戏别玩","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199164758035/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p010","recommendation":"推荐","text":"游戏设计很巧妙，战斗效果极佳","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199723068258/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p011","recommendation":"推荐","text":"有很多玩法，画面与操作感都很还原","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199639982524/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p012","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法不复杂，战斗很激情","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198793731598/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p013","recommendation":"推荐","text":"不错的玩法与节奏，前期很爽，中期开始打BOSS上强度了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199714866978/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p014","recommendation":"推荐","text":"挺好玩的，游戏内容非常丰富，后面更新的东西也很多，也很值得期待","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198784259986/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p015","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"玩了几个小时 冲了168 但是 10元和 30 68元档的东西尼领取不了 要一档一档冲 就这点不推荐完全抗货过分可耻","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199029142208/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p016","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩真爽，挂通宵收益满满","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198741765018/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p017","recommendation":"推荐","text":"战斗效果很棒，特效惊人，各类系统触发的效果很显著","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199640300962/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p018","recommendation":"推荐","text":"停止的玩的，版本的内容量很多，也一直保持了更新","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199731843307/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p019","recommendation":"推荐","text":"适合长期玩的版本，内容量很庞大，玩不腻","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198741860839/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p020","recommendation":"推荐","text":"有自己的想法，在玩法设计上有很多独特的玩法内容。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198739865499/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p021","recommendation":"推荐","text":"感觉挺不错的，玩着很带感啊","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198740385743/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p022","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法很多，趣味比较强，追求永不停息","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198738059912/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p023","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法很爽，传奇嘛，砍就行了，很带感","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199287171101/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p024","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"这爆率，丢人现眼，5转boss打了100多只，爆不出一件2转剑甲3转剑甲，爆一堆1转装备，早点下架行吗，太恶心了。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090184203/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p025","recommendation":"推荐","text":"很正统的传奇，有意思，通宵有意思了","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199702379534/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p026","recommendation":"推荐","text":"很不错的传奇，战斗体验很好，玩法节奏不错","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198741465368/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p027","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"引擎太差，移动不智能和白痴一样。技能也是一样有的根本没用","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199766994028/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p028","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"这是一个不停弹出充值的游戏，当你达到转生7转，你会发现装备已经无法通过掉落获得，获得的方式就是充值。游戏里全是游戏公司的马甲，诱导其他玩家充值，然后开新区重复操作。评论区大量的水军刷好评，只能说国内弄传奇赚钱这群人，真是屎一样的商业逻辑，根本就不懂游戏。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198199086097/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p029","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"一直白屏，不知道什么原因","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/138310/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p030","recommendation":"推荐","text":"操作感有，能够体验到当初玩传奇的感觉","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198738264114/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p031","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法通透，战斗操作简单但又有操作空间，在战力相差不悬殊的情况下，可以打出个人的操作感","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198793721881/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p032","recommendation":"推荐","text":"很不错的传奇版本，热血激情仍在","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198740111976/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p033","recommendation":"推荐","text":"可以值得玩玩，内容多，玩法多，战斗爽快拉满","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199702887360/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p034","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"法师道士弱化的太厉害","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198758280222/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p035","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"垃圾服","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198450942172/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p036","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"垃圾玩意","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199735740784/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p037","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"垃圾 骗钱的游戏 充钱也是挂机，冲少了机都挂不了， 后台修改爆率，根本就不爆东西， 不充钱不爆东西。","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199014113713/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p038","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"这游戏巨坑，7转后，装备就只能靠大量氪金了，爆率被控死了的，体验巨差","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198110057324/recommended/4518440/"},{"id":"p039","recommendation":"推荐","text":"颇有特色，值得期待后续的","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198740003380/recommended/4518440/"}],"groups":[{"key":"funny","label":"欢乐","review_ids":["p001","p002","p004","p005","p006","p007","p008","p028"]},{"key":"helpful","label":"最有价值的","review_ids":["p002","p003","p004","p005","p006","p007","p008","p009","p010","p011","p012","p013","p014","p015","p016","p017","p018","p019","p020","p021","p022","p023","p024","p025","p026","p027","p028","p029","p030","p031","p032","p033","p034","p035","p036","p037","p038","p039"]},{"key":"recent","label":"最新","review_ids":["p002","p003","p004","p005","p006","p007","p008","p009","p010","p011","p012","p013","p014","p015","p016","p017","p018","p019","p020","p021","p022","p023","p024","p025","p026","p027","p028","p029","p030","p031","p032","p033","p034","p035","p036","p037","p038","p039"]},{"key":"summary","label":"概要","review_ids":["p010","p014","p015","p016","p018","p019","p020","p023","p024","p026","p027","p028","p033","p034","p035","p037","p038"]}]},"curator":{"label":"鉴赏家","readable_count":1,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"c001","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"Uses genAi in game creation","url":"https://sto